# Vault-DB skill activations (symlinks into ~/brain/skills/{claude,codex}).
# Activation is a machine-local transaction: these resolve only on the machine
# that has the vault, so tracking them would push dead links to every clone.
# The vault DB is the source of truth; re-activate with a symlink, never a copy
# (copies fork -- these did, and kept naming the pre-consolidation vault path).
.claude/skills/pickup
.claude/skills/wrapup
.claude/skills/lsat-lab-mega-set
.claude/skills/lsat-lab-transcribe
.claude/skills/lsat-u-architecture
.claude/skills/lsatu-cc-handoff
.claude/skills/shadcn
.agents/skills/pickup
.agents/skills/wrapup
.agents/skills/lsat-u-architecture
.agents/skills/lsatu-cc-handoff
